  "solution": {
    "text": "For $\\mathrm{KO}_2, \\mathrm{O}_2^{-}$has unpaired $e^{-} \\Rightarrow$ paramagnetic\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{O}_2^{-} \\text {: Total } e^{-} s=16+1=17 \\\\\n\\sigma 1 s^2, \\sigma^* 1 s^2 \\sigma 2 s^2, \\sigma^* 2 s^2, \\sigma 2 p_z^2 \\pi 2 p_x^{1+1} \\\\\n=\\pi 2 p_y^{1+1}, \\pi^* 2 p_x^{1+1}=\\pi 2 p_y^1\n\\end{gathered}\n$$",
